domain CURRENT_VERSION_LABEL:
  description "Align existing browser assertions with the owner accepted named version display rule."
evidence FAILURE:
  "All four E2E files executed with exact browser1193: seven pass and three fail on old standalone V3 heading or retirement message. Actual page text names character definition v3."
evidence AUTHORITY:
  "Read docs/version-display-rules.md: owner requires target plus version; existing schema IDs and historical contracts are unchanged. Accepted ADR0051 follows observed accounting and named versions."
premise BOUNDS:
  "Change only three expected display strings in two existing tests; retain every behavior and browser step, no production edit. Further downstream failures remain unresolved and will not be bypassed. Existing verification heads are preserved until exact Cause revision review."
premise ALTERNATIVES:
  "Reverting UI to ambiguous standalone V3 contradicts owner rule. Removing browser assertions hides a current presentation obligation."
decision D1 based_on FAILURE, AUTHORITY, BOUNDS, ALTERNATIVES:
  "Audit then update expected labels and rerun both affected specifications using disposable local configuration."
